{"version":1,"content":"<p>警方搗破一個正在籌備的電話詐騙中心，拘捕7名本地男女，包括中心主腦，涉嫌「串謀詐騙」。</p><p>調查顯示，涉案集團以短租方式租用一個觀塘工廈單位，準備用作電話詐騙中心。</p><p>警方於單位內檢獲大量電話卡及詐騙講稿，初步相信集團未正式營運，故未有人受害。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T09:37:48.942554+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T09:07:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T09:38:44.270312+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T09:37:48.942554+00:00","content_hash":"1e8add70b95ba7abded3c5b4c845278e8b16f4ae529302995f34152e879c5768","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T09:37:48.942554+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-blocked","latest_error":"HTTP 403"},"content_capture":null}